OL,3,ABurnham setting out new UK-EU deal in
OL,4,Athe House of Commons
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is setting out his new
OL,7,FUK-EU deal in the House of Commons,
OL,8,Fafter it was agreed with European
OL,9,Fleaders on Friday - watch live above
OL,11,FHe says "too many bridges were burned
OL,12,Fwith Europe" during the first Brexit
OL,13,Fdeal, and Britain should consider a
OL,14,F"range of options" going forward
OL,16,FThe new deal includes a youth mobility
OL,17,Fscheme, scrapping most checks on
OL,18,FBritish food exports, and the linking
OL,19,Fof EU and UK emissions trading systems
OL,20,F- see a recap here
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
