OL,3,ABurnham setting out new UK-EU deal in
OL,4,Athe House of Commons
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the CBI conference in London,
OL,7,Fcabinet minister Louise Haigh says the
OL,8,Fdeal will "bring down the cost of
OL,9,Fbusiness [and] help with the cost of
OL,10,Ffood"
OL,12,FBut Conservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,13,Fsays reopening the Brexit debate is
OL,14,F"the last thing our country needs"
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Burnham says he will ignore
OL,17,F"stuck in the past" former prime
OL,18,Fministers who have criticised his
OL,19,Fapproach to the EU - what have they
OL,20,Fsaid?
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
