OL,3,AIsraeli attacks have turned Gaza into
OL,4,A'toxic wasteland', Oxfam says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxfam International's executive
OL,7,Fdirector, Amitabh Behar, accuses Israel
OL,8,Fof "environmental war crimes" as part
OL,9,Fof an "ongoing genocide in Gaza."
OL,11,F"The destruction and contamination of
OL,12,FGaza will have fundamentally degraded
OL,13,Fthe environmental conditions necessary
OL,14,Ffor human safety and survival," he
OL,15,Fsays.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
